── UNKNOWN NAME ────────────────────────── E0211_rust_vec_macro.lt:2:12  [E0211]

Stilt has no `vec!`: a list is written in brackets, as `[1, 2]`:

  2 │   let xs = vec![1, 2, 3]
    │            ^^^

A list is written in brackets, and its type is `List<T>`.

To fix it, delete `vec!`:

  2 │   let xs = vec![1, 2, 3]
    │            ----
